def binary_search(arr: list, target) -> int:
    lo, hi = 0, len(arr) - 1
    while lo <= hi:
        mid = (lo + hi) >> 1
        if arr[mid] == target:
            return mid
        elif arr[mid] < target:
            lo = mid + 1
        else:
            hi = mid - 1
    return -1
```

Returns the index of `target`, or -1 if not found. O(log n) time, O(1) space.

